=== affine_injective (per-position + pinning) ===
2*oh+wh (wh range 2) injective: true
K*i+k (k range <= K) injective: true
3*i+j (j range <= 3) injective: true
triangular (s1, s1+s2) injective: true
i+j (both ranges > 1) rejected: true
stride*o+k (k range > stride) rejected: true
3*a+4*b over (3,2) rejected (known-incomplete: the map IS injective): true
=== is_injective (with product-iterator coverage) ===
is_injective 2*oh+wh: true
is_injective rejects i+j: true
is_injective rejects an uncovered contraction symbol: true
=== lowering payoff: injective + surjective scatter skips neutral init ===
pool-backward scatter injective: true
pool-backward scatter surjective: true
pool-backward scatter skips neutral-init (surjective && injective): true
